    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what does \"taking control\" even look like when everything is already ruined? if i keep going, i'm just going to keep making more mistakes and making them hate me more. i feel like if i just stop now, while they still have those good memories of me, it would be better than watching me completely fall apart over the next few years. like, wouldn't it be better for them to remember the person i was, instead of what i've become?",
